{"ref":"BDB, מַחֲזֶה","hw":"מַחֲזֶה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲזֶה</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>vision</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:1\" href=\"/Genesis.15.1\">Gn 15:1</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲזֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:4\" href=\"/Numbers.24.4\">Nu 24:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:16\" href=\"/Numbers.24.16\">16</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.7\">Ez 13:7</a>;—<em>vision, in the ecstatic state</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲזֵה שָׁוְא</span> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְסַם כָּזָב</span>) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.7\">Ez 13:7</a> of the false prophets; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲזֵה שַׁדַּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:4\" href=\"/Numbers.24.4\">Nu 24:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:16\" href=\"/Numbers.24.16\">16</a> (JE; poems of Balaam); <span dir=\"rtl\">הָיָה דְבַר י׳ אֶל־אַבְרָם בַּמַּחֲזֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:1\" href=\"/Genesis.15.1\">Gn 15:1</a> (R) <em>the word of</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>came unto Abram in a vision</em>.","next":"BDB, מֶחֱזָה","prev":"BDB, יַחְזְיָה"}